  <h2>Why might a request not be available?</h2>
  <p>Check incomplete verification, the redeemable balance, method-specific minimums and account or location restrictions. A balance alone does not establish eligibility for a prize. Use the operator's support channel to resolve account-specific issues; do not submit identity documents to this site.</p>
  <h2>Is redemption instant?</h2>
  <p>This dataset does not establish a universal instant payout. Identity checks, request approval and final delivery are different stages. Read the <a href="/redemption-times/">published timing comparison</a> and <a href="/guides/sweepstakes-casino-redemption-methods/">payment-method guide</a> before comparing estimates.</p>
